step Dousing the Flames of Protection
  tip Ride north-west to Jaedenar. The four braziers stand among the Shadow Council's buildings; use the Cleansed Water on each one.
  tip Careful: Shadow Council mobs of level 53-55 fill the cave and often come in large linked groups, many with stuns. A group of 2-3 players is recommended.
  interact 176159 quest 5165.2        -- Below ground
  interact 176160 quest 5165.3        -- Below ground
  interact 176158 quest 5165.1        -- Below ground
  interact 176161 quest 5165.4        -- Below ground

