# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Northern Felwood

step Bloodvenom Post
  tip Ride north along the road, past Jaedenar, to Bloodvenom Post.
  turnin 4741                         -- Trull Failbane
  note Trull's next Wild Guardians would bring you back here from Winterspring. Skip it.

step A Final Blow
  tip Moora, Salia and Shadow Lord Fel'dan wait at the back of Shadow Hold, the cave in Jaedenar's north. Clear the tunnel as you go.
  tip Careful: The three bosses fight as a group. Kill the nearby mobs first so you don't pull extra enemies.
  kill 9861 quest 5242.1              -- Below ground
  kill 9860 quest 5242.2              -- Below ground
  collect 13207 quest 5242.3          -- Below ground

