# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Darkwhisper Gorge and Winterfall Village

step Darkwhisper Gorge
  tip Ride east, then south down Frostwhisper Gorge. The Frostmaul giants there are elite level 59: keep to the middle and keep moving. The strange source is at the mouth of Darkwhisper Gorge, at the south end.
  goto 59.8,74.2 "Darkwhisper Gorge"
  complete 4842

step Donova Snowden
  tip Ride back west to Frostfire Hot Springs.
  turnin 4842

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Winterspring

step Donova Snowden
  zone Winterspring
  tip Back into the Timbermaw tunnel and take the Winterspring exit; Donova camps by the hot springs just outside.
  turnin 5086 optional
  accept 5087 optional

step Winterfall Runners
  tip Only if you carry Winterfall Runners: the runners walk the road from Timbermaw Hold toward Winterfall Village in small groups. Each one carries a crate.
  tip Careful: Turning in spawns three or four level 56-57 Winterfall ambushers that attack you; you can escape them while mounted, in stealth or with Feign Death, and they then gather by the lake so you can take the next quest.
  collect 12829 quest 5087.1 optional

