# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Level 60

step Dungeon instead of grinding
  tip Optional. Running Stratholme, Scholomance, Lower Blackrock Spire or Blackrock Depths with a group instead of grinding gets you there faster.
  note Optional: with a group, a 55-60 dungeon replaces the grind below.

step Grind to 60
  tip The quests run out here. Rabid Shardtooths prowl Frostwhisper Gorge in southern Winterspring, south of the road from Everlook.
  goto 60.1,71.2 "Frostwhisper Gorge"
  level 60 -- grind on Rabid Shardtooth at Frostwhisper Gorge, Winterspring
  train class optional only Warrior,Hunter,Rogue,Priest,Shaman,Mage,Warlock -- In Orgrimmar: fly from Everlook
  train class optional only Druid,Paladin -- In Thunder Bluff: fly from Everlook
